"symbolic icons.<br> - <strong>Refresh</strong>: Re-apply color/font at a "
"fixed interval, useful for widgets that recreate or recolor content "
"themselves.<br>To restore the <strong>Mask<strong> and <strong>Color Effect</"
"strong> disable and restart Plasma or logout."
