#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid "How to use"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid ""
"1. Enable <b>Log icon changes</b> above<br>2. Run <b>journalctl -f</b> from "
"terminal<br>3. Hover the System tray entry or trigger an icon change<br>4. "
"Copy one of the properties: icon SHA1, icon name, name or title<br>5. Add a "
"new rule with the matching property you choose and specify the replacement "
"icon name or file"
msgstr ""
"1、启用上方的<b>记录图标变更</b><br>2、在终端运行 <b>journalctl -f</b>"
"<br>3、将鼠标悬停在系统托盘项上或触发一次图标变更<br>4、复制其中一项属性：图标 SHA1、图标名称、名称或标题"
"<br>5、新建一条规则，填入选择的匹配属性，并指定替换图标的名称或文件"

#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: There are some rules without icon as there was no matching one "
"in Papirus, you can override those with your own icons by copying the rule "
"to <b>User Replacements</b>"
msgstr "<b>注意</b>：部分规则没有图标，因为 Papirus 中没有匹配项。可以将规则复制到<b>用户规则</b>中，用自己的图标覆盖它们。"

#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: Some applications like Signal are missing accumulated "
"notification icons, contribution of missing icons via GitHub pull request or "
"issue is very welcome, please do so by providing the the description + icon "
"SHA1/icon name/title/name + icon-name from Papirus (panel/status icons only "
"if no matching icon exists, otherwise it can be omitted)"
msgstr ""
"<b>注意</b>：部分应用（如 Signal）缺少累积通知图标。欢迎通过 GitHub 拉取请求或议题贡献缺失的图标，"
"请提供说明，以及图标 SHA1、图标名称、标题或名称中的一项，还需提供 Papirus 中的图标名称"
"（若没有匹配图标，请提供面板或状态图标；否则可省略）。"

#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: Matching properties (especially the SHA1) may change when "
"applications get updated, rules will need to be updated when that happens."
msgstr "<b>注意</b>：应用更新后，匹配属性（尤其是 SHA1）可能会变化，届时需要更新相应规则。"

#: ../contents/ui/configTrayIconsReplacer.qml
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: Plasma widgets in the system tray are not supported by this "
"feature as widgets provide their own visual content and logic."
msgstr "<b>注意</b>：系统托盘中的 Plasma 挂件不受此功能支持，因为这类挂件自带视觉内容和逻辑。"

