#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid "Create widget islands by placing separator widgets around them."
msgstr "在挂件两侧放置分隔挂件，即可创建挂件群岛。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid ""
"<strong>How to use</strong><br>1. Add the widget that will act as islands "
"separator to the panel(by default the Plasma's Panel Spacer widget will be "
"used)<br>2. Select the separator widget below<br>3. Add as many separators "
"as you need and move them to create islands."
msgstr ""
"<strong>使用方法</strong><br>1、将用作群岛分隔的挂件加入面板（默认使用 Plasma 的面板间隔件）"
"<br>2、在下方选择该分隔挂件<br>3、按需添加多个分隔挂件并移动它们，即可创建群岛。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid ""
"<strong>Notes</strong><br>- Widget custom background or border is required "
"for this option to have a visible effect.<br>- If the widgets in your panel "
"have different thickness, add margins to the widgets custom background in "
"the Appearance tab."
msgstr ""
"<strong>注意</strong><br>· 挂件需要有自定义背景或边框，此选项才有可见效果。"
"<br>· 如果面板中各挂件厚度不一，请在外观标签页中为挂件的自定义背景添加外边距。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid ""
"<strong>Need a separator widget?</strong><br>- <a href=\"%1\">Panel "
"Colorizer Islands Separator</a> visible only in Edit Mode.<br>- <a "
"href=\"%2\">Advanced Separator</a> always visible and configurable."
msgstr ""
"<strong>需要分隔挂件？</strong><br>· <a href=\"%1\">Panel Colorizer Islands Separator</a> 仅在编辑模式下可见。"
"<br>· <a href=\"%2\">Advanced Separator</a> 始终可见且可配置。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid "Separator widget:"
msgstr "分隔挂件："

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid ""
"Select the widget that will act as separator for the islands.<br><br>Note "
"that the separator widget itself does not need to be visible for it to work, "
"so you can use an invisible spacer/separator for example."
msgstr "选择将用作群岛分隔的挂件。<br><br>注意：分隔挂件本身无需可见即可生效，例如可以使用不可见的间隔件或分隔挂件。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid "Require two separators per island:"
msgstr "每个群岛需要两个分隔挂件："

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid ""
"Always require two separators for a group of widgets to become an island. By "
"default, an arrangement of<br>%1 creates two islands.<br><br>Enabling this "
"option makes it so that islands do not share separators, so for example an "
"arrangement of<br>%2 is required to create two islands.<br><br>Enable this "
"if your islands separator is not a panel spacer and you want to explicitly "
"define the start and end of each island."
msgstr ""
"一组挂件始终需要两个分隔挂件才能构成群岛。默认情况下，<br>%1 的排列会创建两个群岛。"
"<br><br>启用此选项后，群岛之间不共享分隔挂件，例如需要<br>%2 的排列才能创建两个群岛。"
"<br><br>如果使用的群岛分隔挂件不是面板间隔件，并希望明确指定每个群岛的起点和终点，请启用此选项。"

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid "Blacklist separator widgets:"
msgstr "将分隔挂件加入黑名单："

#: ../contents/ui/configWidgetIslands.qml
msgid "Disable customization from separator widgets"
msgstr "禁用分隔挂件的自定义"

#: ../contents/ui/main.qml
msgid "This widget must be placed in a panel to work!"
msgstr "此挂件必须放在面板中才能工作！"

#: ../contents/ui/main.qml
msgid "Hide widget (visible in panel Edit Mode)"
msgstr "隐藏挂件（面板编辑模式下可见）"

#: ../contents/ui/main.qml
msgid ""
"A Plasmashell restart is required to remove all the modifications made by "
"%1. Run systemctl restart --user plasma-plasmashell or log out and log back "
"in."
msgstr "需要重启 Plasmashell 才能移除 %1 所做的全部修改。运行 systemctl restart --user plasma-plasmashell，或注销后重新登录。"

